                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNGEN ZUR ZERSTÖRUNG UND EINDÄMMUNG VON PATHOGENEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS ET DISPOSITIFS POUR PERTURBER ET CONTENIR DES AGENTS PATHOGÈNES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS AND DEVICES TO DISRUPT AND CONTAIN PATHOGENS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided herein are fabric materials and debridement devices comprising gel-forming hydrofibres for disrupting a biofilm, loosening, or sequestering unwanted materials from wounds, and uses thereof. In particular, debridement and detection devices for selective and atraumatic removal of unwanted tissues and for detection of a wound infection are provided.</p>
